{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"I probably shouldn't be asking, my apologies, I tend to bowl right over sensitive subjects.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:10:16.076000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866728662065086474","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Several. Some of us choose to not carry on the curse or taint anyone else's blood.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:10:59.798000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866728845449363456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"No its ok.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:11:20.483000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866728932207755294","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"I see. You wish to end the curse, one way or another.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:11:43.913000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866729030479904768","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:12:18.030000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866729173577891850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"I cant ask anyone to love me like this. We would never be able to have children. \"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:13:31.252000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866729480693350420","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Tell me, which is more important to you, personally? Love or children?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:14:55.048000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866729832158330880","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\" Honestly. I have never been in love and have never wanted child because of the curse so I don't know. \"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:16:38.215000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866730264872747030","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"If you can imagine love without children, why couldn't someone else?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:20:29.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866731233966030878","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Thats the thing. That's not fair I can't ask someone to do that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:22:25.316000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866731720720252929","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"MinaPoe","id":"443806147649208341","is_bot":0,"username":"minapoe"},"author_id":"443806147649208341","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"(drow child is talking over at the Voice btw)","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:23:27.239000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866731980442959912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"You are willing to give up your dream of having children simply for the selfless wish to end the curse. You cannot imagine another willing to do the same for you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:26:04.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866732642032287775","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"You must suffer for the curse twice, to be denied both love and children. That is also not fair.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:26:47.284000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866732819492503572","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Life has shown me a its not fair a lot\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:28:43.911000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866733308661202974","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Then let it be unfair. If life is unfair, and it is unfair to be loved, then be loved.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:29:10.796000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866733421425328138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"It is only ok for a person to make sacrifices if that person is you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:29:46.305000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T17:30:07.640000Z","id":"866733570361131048","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Why make someone else suffer?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:31:55.963000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866734114187378730","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Why make yourself suffer?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:32:06.247000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866734157320683580","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Because it's my family curse. \"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:32:40.732000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866734301961388052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"Why must you make every sacrifice that is to be made? Let other people decide what burdens they wish to carry.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:32:40.836000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866734302396678154","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"The curse is only that children will be born with the curse. Nothing more. You have cursed yourself with your desire to destroy it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:33:59.510000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866734632380661760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"And that's fine, but allow others to share some of that burden with you.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:34:24.378000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866734736683565086","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"If I open my heart then I risk it being broken.\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:35:42.321000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866735063600594955","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"855583918468235264","content":"\"What if they tell me that they cant love me like this?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T17:36:07.379000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-19T17:37:39.697000Z","id":"866735168701857853","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
